    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Tigers Kevin McGonigle, Riley Greene and Dillon Dingler are finalists for Silver Slugger Awards. McGonigle is actually a finalist at two different positions (SS + utility). Winners to be announced Nov. 17.",
      "likes": 20,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-05T16:06:56.392Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzlaroresk2p",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Has there ever been another player that's been a finalist at two positions in the same year?",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "theonlycawlors.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can he actually win them both or if he won at SS would it disqualify the other?",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "leesutk13.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bruh none of them hit at least .300 AVG what a joke.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "tonydapizza.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "タイガースのケビン・マクゴニグル、ライリー・グリーン、ディロン・ディングラーがシルバースラッガー賞のファイナリストに。マクゴニグルは遊撃手とユーティリティの2部門で選出。発表は11月17日。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "mattgelb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Matt Gelb",
      "team": "フィリーズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "For generations of CB West kids, Kitty Semisch was one of those teachers whose passion for reading and writing critically made a lasting impression. I know I was one of them. So, so sad to see this: www.phillyburbs.com/story/news/a...",
      "likes": 20,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-05T14:39:01.626Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hoy6e5tru27j3r7xyfzdojwk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzl3uiea6ko5",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "CB West出身の多くの子どもたちにとって、キティ・セミッシュは読むことと批判的に書くことへの情熱で忘れがたい印象を残した教師だった。私もその一人だ。本当に悲しい知らせ。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kevin McGonigle is one of a few Silver Slugger finalists at utility and another position (Jake Bauers and Fernando Tatis Jr. are the others). Coaches are not allowed to vote for the same player at multiple spots. So, while McGonigle could theoretically win both, it's unlikely.",
      "likes": 10,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-05T21:20:01.372Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzlsbjjfv22b",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "マクゴニグルはユーティリティと他のポジションの両方でシルバースラッガー賞のファイナリストになった数少ない一人（ジェイク・バウワーズ、フェルナンド・タティスJr.も同様）。コーチは同じ選手を複数のポジションで投票できないため、理論上は2部門受賞もあり得るが、可能性は低い。"
    },
